ount)<br />3.) Total Medical Billing amount</b></span></div><div><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\"><br /></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Additional information that may further aid in your request:</span></b></span><b><span data-stringify-type=\"bold\"><br /></span></b><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\">4.) Has case fully concluded?<br />5.) Is this a Minor's Comp?<br />6.) Please provide anticipated payment date</span></b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><span data-stringify-type=\"paragraph-break\"></span></div><div><b style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\">***PLEASE CHECK YOUR SPAM FOLDER BEFORE FOLLOWING UP***</b></div><div><span data-stringify-type=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\" data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Your email request has been recorded and we will be processed in the order received.&nbsp;Please avoid duplicate requests as we do receive a high volume of calls, emails, and faxes.&nbsp;<br /><br /></span></div><div><span data-stringify-type=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\">Thank you!</span><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\"></span></div>",
      "text": "Did you know you can submit a negotiation via the Attorney Portal? \nGet it approved much faster than email or fax\n\n\nEliminate\ntime consuming tasks that can be handled from a single web page. Services available\ninclude:\n\n\n\n· \nAccess to all patient/client studies & documents\n· \nUpload new RX/orders\n· \nAssign a case manager\n· \nE-sign all pending liens one by one or in bulk\n· \nView current patient bill balance\n· \nProvide case updates for ongoing cases\n· \nNegotiate bills and submit offers\n· \nPay via credit card or ACH\n· \nManage notification preferences\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAccess @ Precise.RadFlow360.com\nDon’t have an account? Click “Request a login” button on the site\n\n\nThe attorney portal is NOW live. \nSign up to save your office time and money.\n\n\n\n\nFaxing is\nbeing discontinued May 1st. All\nnotifications will continue to be sent via email or access anytime via the\nportal.\n\n\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n\n**This is an automated response confirming your email was received**\n\n\nPlease allow up to 3 full business days for a response. Avoid following up on your request via email as this may cause a delay in our response. If you do not receive a response within 3 business days, please call us at 818-907-7723 ext. 9004 and someone will assist you. \n\n\nRequired info in order to process your offer:\n1.) Patient's Full Name, DOB, DOI\n2.) Total Settlement/Awarded amount (or anticipated amount)\n3.) Total Medical Billing amount\n\n\nAdditional information that may further aid in your request:\n4.) Has case fully concluded?\n5.) Is this a Minor's Comp?\n6.) Please provide anticipated payment date\n\n\n\n***PLEASE CHECK YOUR SPAM FOLDER BEFORE FOLLOWING UP***\nYour email request has been recorded and we will be processed in the order received. Please avoid duplicate requests as we do receive a high volume of calls, emails, and faxes. \n\n\nThank you!",
